



>> CoffeeGrounds := वस्तु नयाँ.
CoffeeGrounds जब: ['extract'] गर: { <- ['coffee']. }.

>> CoffeeMachine := वस्तु नयाँ.
CoffeeMachine जब: ['init'] गर: {
	आफ्नो coffeegrounds := CoffeeGrounds नयाँ.
}.
CoffeeMachine जब: ['नयाँ'] गर: { <- CoffeeMachine `new init.
}.

CoffeeMachine जब: ['makeTea'] गर: { <- (आफ्नो tealeaves extract). }.
CoffeeMachine जब: ['makeCoffee'] गर: { <- (आफ्नो coffeegrounds extract). }.

>> coffeeDream := CoffeeMachine नयाँ.

आउटपुट लेख:
	coffeeDream 
	makeCoffee.

आउटपुट लेख:
	coffeeDream 
	makeTea.
